comments.text:
@Flipkart Kindly pay attention to customer issues. I recently purchased an AC from Flipkart, but within 3 days it stopped cooling properly. I raised multiple complaints and contacted customer support more than 20 times through calls, email, and WhatsApp, but I did not receive any proper response or resolution.

Finally, someone from the escalation/Grievance team attended the call, but the call was disconnected without any solution being provided.

Based on my experience, I would advise customers to be careful before purchasing high-value electronic products like ACs, refrigerators, washing machines, and other home appliances from Flipkart if proper after-sales support is not available.
